WEBVTT

00:13.030 --> 00:15.020
Heave ho, heave ho!

00:15.020 --> 00:16.910
What is this, <i>Pop-up -bleep-</i>?

00:16.910 --> 00:19.990
Please hear us, Mitama-sama!

00:21.160 --> 00:23.260
We have brought the successor.

00:24.170 --> 00:25.120
Good work.

00:25.440 --> 00:29.960
And now, my son Urabe Yukito will
be entering the ritual of musubi!

00:30.630 --> 00:34.780
My dad is the founder of this
obviously sketchy-looking sect.

00:34.780 --> 00:38.510
Which is why I've had so many unreasonable
things happen to me since I was a kid.

00:39.470 --> 00:42.220
But that ends today.

00:42.220 --> 00:44.350
Submerged in water for three days,

00:44.350 --> 00:49.130
he shall overcome death and rise
up as the new leader of our sect.

00:49.770 --> 00:51.250
Don't do this, Dad!

00:51.250 --> 00:52.550
I'm serious, stop!

00:52.550 --> 00:55.260
I'm telling you, this is straight-up murder!

00:55.260 --> 00:56.610
It's a ritual.

00:57.140 --> 00:58.370
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:58.370 --> 00:59.370
<i>There's no talking to him.</i>

01:00.840 --> 01:05.220
Our God, Mitama-sama, is
omniscient and omnipotent!

01:05.220 --> 01:06.790
Therefore, invincible!

01:07.990 --> 01:10.360
<i>I don't even care anymore.</i>

01:13.140 --> 01:14.970
Do not fret, Yukito.

01:14.970 --> 01:18.170
Mitama-sama will surely save you.

01:20.880 --> 01:22.640
So you, too...

01:22.640 --> 01:24.600
Pray for Mitama-sama to bring you salvation!

01:24.600 --> 01:25.560
Purify yourself!

01:25.560 --> 01:26.890
Cleanse yourself!

01:26.890 --> 01:28.300
Believe only in our one God!

01:28.300 --> 01:30.310
Then your wishes shall be granted!

01:30.310 --> 01:32.440
Be blessed by the supreme sacred treasure!

01:32.440 --> 01:34.550
Go forth, Yukito!

01:45.790 --> 01:47.210
<i>What is this?</i>

01:47.210 --> 01:48.140
Successor!

01:47.520 --> 01:50.020
<i>Could this be my life
flashing before my eyes?</i>

01:48.140 --> 01:49.130
Good work!

01:49.130 --> 01:50.790
Wait, stop, let me down!

01:50.790 --> 01:52.630
<i>You really do see it right before you die.</i>

01:53.850 --> 01:56.010
With the ritual of fire-bathing,

01:53.850 --> 01:57.930
<i>Oh wow, I was still really cute back then.</i>

01:56.010 --> 01:57.930
you commune with God!

01:57.930 --> 02:00.160
With Mitama-sama!

02:00.160 --> 02:01.360
<i>But yeah,</i>

02:01.360 --> 02:03.940
<i>so many terrible things happened to me.</i>

02:03.940 --> 02:06.100
<i>My eyes look deader and deader.</i>

02:06.100 --> 02:08.160
Today, I'm going to be a new me—

02:07.190 --> 02:08.160
<i>Surprisingly,</i>

02:08.160 --> 02:12.270
<i>I was still so full of hope
when I entered high school.</i>

02:12.270 --> 02:15.610
<b>Entrance
 Ceremony</b>

02:12.820 --> 02:16.790
<i>But then it was just one
crazy thing after the other.</i>

02:16.070 --> 02:17.190
<b>Fortune</b>

02:16.070 --> 02:17.190
<b>Worst Luck</b>

02:17.380 --> 02:21.010
<i>This is the worst.</i>

02:20.160 --> 02:22.230
<i>No, don't!</i>

02:21.010 --> 02:23.040
<i>What the hell is my life?</i>

02:23.530 --> 02:24.980
<i>I'm watching porn,</i>

02:24.980 --> 02:26.880
<i>but my eyes are completely dead.</i>

02:28.370 --> 02:30.490
<i>Not a decent scene flashed before my eyes.</i>

02:30.490 --> 02:31.880
<i>God, my ass.</i>

02:31.880 --> 02:33.970
<i>Omniscient and omnipotent, my ass.</i>

02:33.970 --> 02:35.370
<i>If you truly exist,</i>

02:35.370 --> 02:38.740
<i>how about letting me be reborn in
a world without gods or religion?</i>

02:38.740 --> 02:41.760
<i>Then I could make some friends
 and lead a normal life.</i>

02:42.570 --> 02:43.890
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

02:43.890 --> 02:48.890
Episode 1:
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mikami

Please purify us
Please cleanse us

Lord Mikami
We beg for you to hear our prayer


02:50.480 --> 02:53.240
Let's see. For men,

02:53.240 --> 02:55.340
you need to squeeze this lever, and...

03:06.790 --> 03:08.930
Oh, he's looking lively now!

03:08.930 --> 03:12.630
Now I just need stroke this lever
up and down vigorously...

03:14.040 --> 03:15.840
Wh-What are you doing?!

03:19.380 --> 03:20.110
I'm so sorry!

03:20.180 --> 03:20.780
I'm so sorry!

03:20.840 --> 03:21.420
I'm so sorry!

03:21.480 --> 03:22.100
I'm so sorry!

03:22.170 --> 03:22.750
I'm so sorry!

03:22.750 --> 03:24.680
It's fine now.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.890
No, it's not!

03:27.140 --> 03:30.400
I will serve you until
you are completely healed!

03:30.400 --> 03:31.540
Serve me?

03:32.000 --> 03:34.980
I work in that restaurant over there.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.480
My name is Alural.

03:36.730 --> 03:37.680
Alural?

03:37.680 --> 03:38.480
Yes!

03:38.480 --> 03:40.780
As an apology, you can eat there
any time you want, for free.

03:42.240 --> 03:45.530
<i>I feel like I've seen this
fantasy world before.</i>

03:45.880 --> 03:51.790
<i>This must be that alternate
world rebirth fad!</i>

03:51.790 --> 03:54.350
I'm so glad he's feeling better.

03:54.350 --> 03:56.660
This book was right.

03:56.660 --> 03:58.500
Can I ask you a question?

03:58.500 --> 03:59.050
Yes!

03:59.440 --> 04:01.050
Where is the Guild?

04:01.440 --> 04:02.420
Guild?

04:02.420 --> 04:04.140
The Adventurers' Guild.

04:04.140 --> 04:06.010
There must be one in the first village.

04:07.390 --> 04:13.020
It's like a job association where
adventurers meet to exchange information.

04:13.020 --> 04:15.810
Oh, you mean you want to
work here in the village?

04:15.810 --> 04:17.980
This way. Please follow me.

04:17.980 --> 04:18.900
Right.

04:19.220 --> 04:20.800
<i>I knew it!</i>

04:20.800 --> 04:24.560
<i>This is the alternate world life I
dreamt of, with swords and magic!</i>

04:24.560 --> 04:27.390
<i>My previous life was beyond awful.</i>

04:27.390 --> 04:30.240
<i>We're gonna make up for lost time!</i>

04:32.210 --> 04:33.850
Starting out with a farming quest?!

04:33.850 --> 04:35.460
That's way too boring a start!

04:36.990 --> 04:38.080
Hey.

04:39.060 --> 04:42.290
You're the guy Al saved, right?

04:42.290 --> 04:43.600
Al?

04:43.600 --> 04:45.210
<i>Oh, the girl from before.</i>

04:45.210 --> 04:47.600
Every girl in this village is mine.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.760
If you lay a finger on any
one of them, I'll kill—

04:49.760 --> 04:51.430
What was that for?!

04:51.430 --> 04:53.420
Don't hassle him, moron.

04:53.420 --> 04:54.970
Sorry he startled you.

04:54.970 --> 04:55.790
My name's Clen,

04:55.790 --> 04:56.780
this guy's Roy.

04:57.420 --> 04:59.150
May I ask your name?

04:59.720 --> 05:00.650
It's Yukito.

05:01.130 --> 05:01.980
Yukito.

05:02.550 --> 05:03.370
I know it's sudden,

05:03.370 --> 05:05.120
but I have a job for you.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.450
A job?

05:06.450 --> 05:07.490
Please use this.

05:11.440 --> 05:12.600
A dagger.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.710
That's totally a classic starter weapon!

05:15.310 --> 05:17.540
Should I start by vanquishing some goblins?

05:18.730 --> 05:19.670
Goblins?

05:20.080 --> 05:21.880
Oh, I'm ready.

05:26.810 --> 05:29.880
We don't have enough people
to bring in the harvest.

05:29.880 --> 05:30.600
So it's great to have you.

05:31.120 --> 05:32.020
I see.

05:32.020 --> 05:33.380
<i>So this is how it is.</i>

05:33.380 --> 05:35.620
<i>They're testing the player by forcing them</i>

05:35.620 --> 05:37.380
<i>to do boring quests in the beginning.</i>

05:37.380 --> 05:38.980
<i>Then, let's do this right!</i>

05:41.300 --> 05:43.190
What a waste...

05:43.730 --> 05:45.210
Hmmm...

05:45.210 --> 05:46.370
What's wrong?

05:46.370 --> 05:50.010
It's nice that we harvested this much,

05:50.010 --> 05:51.730
but we actually got too much.

05:51.730 --> 05:53.810
We have no way to preserve this fruit,

05:53.810 --> 05:55.540
so the extra will simply
have to be thrown away.

05:55.540 --> 05:58.480
Is there really nothing we can do?

06:06.750 --> 06:08.660
Yukito, I changed my mind about you!

06:08.660 --> 06:11.640
I can't believe you made
booze out of that fruit!

06:11.640 --> 06:12.940
That's right!

06:12.940 --> 06:14.990
Booze is too expensive to buy,

06:14.990 --> 06:17.500
but Yukito just made it!

06:20.400 --> 06:21.650
All right!

06:21.650 --> 06:24.730
Let's keep drinking!

06:27.360 --> 06:30.800
<i>This past month, I've worked the soil,</i>

06:29.360 --> 06:30.530
<b>Yukito worked the land!</b>

06:30.570 --> 06:31.700
<b>Yukito fed the livestock!</b>

06:30.800 --> 06:32.910
<i>taken care of the livestock, made wine...</i>

06:31.740 --> 06:32.910
<b>Yukito made wine!</b>

06:33.980 --> 06:36.680
<i>None of the things that
are supposed to happen</i>

06:36.680 --> 06:38.910
<i>after being reborn into an
alternate world have happened!</i>

06:38.910 --> 06:40.000
Oneechan!

06:40.000 --> 06:42.100
Stop drinking booze and come help me.

06:42.100 --> 06:47.030
I just like to see my adorable
little sister at work!

06:47.030 --> 06:48.710
<i>Siluril is the older sister.</i>

06:48.710 --> 06:49.970
<i>Alural is the younger one.</i>

06:50.360 --> 06:54.630
<i>They're letting me live in the
eatery the two of them run.</i>

06:54.630 --> 06:55.730
<i>I made some whack—</i>

06:55.730 --> 06:57.680
<i>I mean, good friends who're ready to party.</i>

06:57.680 --> 06:59.490
<i>I'm happy about that, but...</i>

07:07.520 --> 07:11.770
Where's my alternate world life
with swords and magic?!

07:12.750 --> 07:14.000
Good one, Yukito!

07:14.000 --> 07:15.530
You're really putting those away!

07:18.480 --> 07:21.080
<i>I want to do something alternate world-like!</i>

07:22.460 --> 07:25.500
Everyone! Run!

07:29.340 --> 07:30.480
A monster?

07:30.480 --> 07:32.630
No. It's a strange beast.

07:33.200 --> 07:33.970
A... what?

07:43.650 --> 07:45.390
Wait, wait! No matter how you slice it,

07:45.390 --> 07:47.500
that's definitely something
from mid to late game!

07:48.310 --> 07:49.650
Leave this to me.

07:59.460 --> 08:01.990
Roy... you actually know magic?

08:03.290 --> 08:04.210
Yukito!

08:04.210 --> 08:05.420
Y-Yeah?!

08:05.460 --> 08:06.920
<b>They ran away!</b>

08:05.700 --> 08:06.920
Run for it!

08:11.220 --> 08:12.630
That was close!

08:12.630 --> 08:14.770
One misstep and we would've been dead.

08:14.770 --> 08:17.300
We're lucky we got away
with this amount of damage.

08:17.300 --> 08:19.010
We didn't actually fight.

08:20.080 --> 08:24.270
This "damage" we got from running into
things as we fled is embarrassing.

08:27.440 --> 08:30.700
Hey! Why don't you fight?!

08:30.700 --> 08:33.700
Fight? We don't stand a chance 
against those strange beasts.

08:34.560 --> 08:37.990
I will not stand for a alternate world
setting where you don't fight monsters!

08:37.990 --> 08:41.470
What was that book you were reading, anyway?!

08:41.470 --> 08:43.840
That's the <i>Strange Beast Strategy Book</i>.

08:43.840 --> 08:47.550
It lists escape strategies and first
aid procedures and all kinds of things.

08:48.750 --> 08:50.600
Escape strategies?

08:50.600 --> 08:52.130
What good is that?

08:54.700 --> 08:59.840
<i>It seems that the concept of magic
does not exist in this world.</i>

08:59.840 --> 09:02.110
<i>Wounds are treated manually, too.</i>

09:04.560 --> 09:06.020
Time to drink!

09:10.380 --> 09:14.270
It's quite different from the life 
in an alternate world I imagined,

09:12.230 --> 09:13.440
<b>Yukito worked the land!</b>

09:13.490 --> 09:14.740
<b>Yukito made wine!</b>

09:14.780 --> 09:15.990
<b>Yukito drank wine!</b>

09:16.030 --> 09:17.200
<b>Yukito spoke to a villager!</b>

09:17.940 --> 09:21.570
but all in all, it's not so bad.

09:22.020 --> 09:24.160
Chug, chug!

09:29.140 --> 09:32.150
And the winner is Yukito!

09:37.190 --> 09:42.480
It seems like the people of the village have
become much more cheerful since your arrival.

09:44.580 --> 09:48.850
If it would please you, maybe you could
stay here in our village forever.

09:49.480 --> 09:50.930
Yeah, huh?

09:50.930 --> 09:53.810
I guess there's nothing like
a demon lord in this world.

09:55.120 --> 09:58.070
<i>Compared to before, how life is now...</i>

09:59.270 --> 10:03.080
I suppose I can thank God for
sending me to this world.

10:03.080 --> 10:03.990
God?

10:07.330 --> 10:11.900
What is that?

10:17.410 --> 10:20.660
<i>Surprisingly, this world is
not only devoid of magic,</i>

10:20.660 --> 10:25.320
<i>it also seems to lack the concept of gods,
religion, or any sort of spirituality.</i>

10:26.130 --> 10:29.850
<i>Perhaps if I'd died back when
that strange beast appeared...</i>

10:34.730 --> 10:36.650
Looks like it's dead.

10:37.610 --> 10:39.110
I'll give it a burial.

10:39.360 --> 10:40.520
<i>A burial?!</i>

10:40.520 --> 10:44.120
<i>How do they bury their dead in this world?</i>

10:44.410 --> 10:46.460
<i>If there are no gods,</i>

10:46.460 --> 10:48.630
<i>the most graveyard-like
place in this village would be...</i>

10:51.590 --> 10:54.240
What are you doing out so early?

10:54.240 --> 10:57.470
You weren't in your room so I got worried.

10:57.960 --> 11:00.720
Oh, so you went out hunting!

11:01.040 --> 11:02.800
Y-Yeah.

11:03.070 --> 11:04.590
Good job, Yukito!

11:04.590 --> 11:05.930
Good job, Yukito-san!

11:06.240 --> 11:08.980
Y-Yeah, but actually...

11:08.980 --> 11:12.020
By the way, Yukito...

11:12.020 --> 11:14.560
You and I are friends, right?

11:14.560 --> 11:16.210
What's this all of the sudden?

11:18.060 --> 11:20.400
I heard a rumor of a
terrifying "forbidden book".

11:20.400 --> 11:21.110
<i>A forbidden book?</i>

11:21.110 --> 11:23.720
Even speaking of it is dangerous.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.960
If anyone heard of this,

11:25.960 --> 11:27.540
I might even get disappeared.

11:28.140 --> 11:32.040
<i>Could this finally be the thing that leads
into the mystery of this alternate world?!</i>

11:35.440 --> 11:37.300
So what is it?

11:38.450 --> 11:41.160
A book about sex!

11:41.800 --> 11:43.410
Sex!

11:44.000 --> 11:45.850
That's just a smut book.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.600
We finally made it.

11:50.130 --> 11:53.040
Is it your first time in the
Imperial capital, Yukito?

11:53.040 --> 11:57.520
Our village is in a fairly
remote region of the empire.

11:57.520 --> 11:59.440
So, why did you come along?

11:59.920 --> 12:02.240
That thing up there is the Imperial palace.

12:02.240 --> 12:05.440
From farming to how to 
deal with strange beasts,

12:05.440 --> 12:09.160
everything we need to live was
taught to us by the emperor.

12:10.800 --> 12:13.870
Oh, and a word of advice.

12:15.120 --> 12:18.880
Try to avoid talking to anyone from the city.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.350
Why's that?

12:20.350 --> 12:23.930
Our village is, how should I
put this, kind of despised.

12:23.930 --> 12:25.090
Despised?

12:25.090 --> 12:26.850
Oh, hey! That's the shop right there!

12:30.730 --> 12:32.670
Welcome.

12:34.780 --> 12:37.000
This... This is it!

12:38.110 --> 12:40.000
<i>An alternate world smut book.</i>

12:40.000 --> 12:41.400
<i>I wonder what's inside.</i>

12:45.620 --> 12:48.640
I can't believe they sell
something this ultra-dirty!

12:48.640 --> 12:50.720
This store... it's dangerous!

12:50.720 --> 12:53.940
This is even more advanced
than the book I have!

12:53.940 --> 12:56.330
This seems more artsy than dirty,

12:56.330 --> 12:59.040
like something you'd find
displayed in a museum.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.530
Displayed?!

13:00.530 --> 13:04.290
What kind of sexually advanced
country are you from?!

13:02.900 --> 13:06.160
In this country, that is super forbidden!

13:06.160 --> 13:07.550
Huh?

13:12.250 --> 13:12.970
What's that?

13:18.580 --> 13:19.190
Begin.

13:30.030 --> 13:33.200
Today's end of life has 
concluded without issue.

13:33.780 --> 13:35.860
What is this?

13:35.860 --> 13:36.930
Let's go.

13:38.310 --> 13:40.340
Hey! What was that?

13:41.660 --> 13:46.150
Our country has what is
called an end of life system.

13:46.150 --> 13:48.290
When the country orders it,

13:48.290 --> 13:50.300
you are to end your own life.

13:50.590 --> 13:52.850
Hang on! What's that about?!

13:53.370 --> 13:55.430
This country? Does that mean you, too?

13:55.430 --> 13:58.670
No, we're kind of special.

13:58.670 --> 14:00.940
We're treated a bit differently.

14:01.440 --> 14:02.730
Don't worry about it.

14:03.400 --> 14:03.940
Let's go.

14:13.740 --> 14:15.350
They dare to come to the capital.

14:15.350 --> 14:17.200
Filthy defects.

14:17.200 --> 14:21.130
They should just dispose of those
people from the "isolation camp".

14:29.950 --> 14:31.850
G-Good evening.

14:33.530 --> 14:35.480
What are you doing?

14:35.480 --> 14:36.840
Sneaking into your bed.

14:36.840 --> 14:37.630
What?

14:39.060 --> 14:40.200
In the book I bought today,

14:40.200 --> 14:43.160
there were methods
for giving men more energy!

14:43.160 --> 14:44.790
I came fully prepared!

14:44.790 --> 14:46.900
I feel like you got that kind of wrong...

14:46.900 --> 14:51.130
I will do my best!

14:50.300 --> 14:52.530
Wait, listen!

14:52.530 --> 14:54.560
Please just take your clothes off!

14:54.560 --> 14:56.590
Yeah, take it off!

14:55.240 --> 14:56.590
Stop! That's...!

14:56.590 --> 14:58.560
Oh, kind of good... Wait, no!

14:58.560 --> 15:00.030
Calm down!

15:00.030 --> 15:01.440
I am so sorry!

15:01.440 --> 15:04.350
Forbidden books really are terrifying.

15:04.350 --> 15:06.000
Have you regained your senses?

15:07.660 --> 15:11.130
I guess I was sent to this
village because I am like this.

15:11.630 --> 15:14.000
Is something going on with this village?

15:14.000 --> 15:16.350
In the afternoon, Roy said something
about people despising you.

15:16.350 --> 15:18.300
This village is an "isolation camp".

15:18.300 --> 15:20.770
This is where outcasts are sent.

15:21.760 --> 15:22.690
Isolation camp?

15:25.690 --> 15:28.570
This brand marks us as residents
of the isolation camp.

15:29.600 --> 15:31.340
Anyone who fears the end of life

15:31.340 --> 15:34.910
or doesn't align with the
country's ways is banished here.

15:36.150 --> 15:39.710
But you don't look at us with disgust.

15:39.710 --> 15:41.570
You laugh with us, you eat with us,

15:41.570 --> 15:43.450
and you teach us all sorts of things,

15:43.450 --> 15:45.540
and let us touch you in 
all sorts of places...

15:45.540 --> 15:45.960
Huh?

15:46.800 --> 15:50.660
No one from outside who's
come here has been like that.

15:50.660 --> 15:52.050
So it made me happy.

15:52.680 --> 15:55.300
I guess I was also disliked.

15:55.640 --> 16:01.200
You and the other people of this
village are the first friends I've made.

16:01.770 --> 16:04.100
I don't care if you're considered outcasts.

16:05.760 --> 16:06.700
Yukito-san...

16:06.700 --> 16:07.320
Yes?

16:08.560 --> 16:10.720
That stone is pretty.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.030
Yeah.

16:12.800 --> 16:16.430
<i>This magatama is the only thing that I
was able to bring with me to this world.</i>

16:16.430 --> 16:19.190
<i>My dad said it was a protective
charm from the sect or something.</i>

16:20.000 --> 16:20.960
You want it?

16:21.920 --> 16:22.820
Oh, no.

16:27.730 --> 16:28.880
Take it.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.420
Sorry it's just a cheap trinket.

16:31.930 --> 16:33.340
Thank you so much!

16:35.320 --> 16:37.140
It's late. You should go to bed.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.470
Okay!

16:50.390 --> 16:54.240
<i>I'm glad to have met you.</i>

17:00.370 --> 17:02.410
You're really okay with that?!

17:03.730 --> 17:05.340
There's nothing we can do.

17:05.340 --> 17:06.700
It's already been decided.

17:08.280 --> 17:11.880
If nothing else, I wish she
could have been spared.

17:14.380 --> 17:17.390
I refuse to accept this!
I'm going to fight it!

17:23.120 --> 17:24.220
Huh?

17:24.220 --> 17:26.220
Are we closed today?

17:29.400 --> 17:29.940
Roy?

17:30.720 --> 17:32.530
Hey! What happened?

17:32.530 --> 17:33.690
They took them.

17:34.780 --> 17:35.910
Damn it!

17:36.900 --> 17:37.820
Yukito...

17:37.820 --> 17:43.760
This village is basically a dump for people
the country has designated as "deviants".

17:43.760 --> 17:45.550
We're not instructed to end our lives,

17:45.550 --> 17:48.020
our lives are forcibly taken!

17:49.260 --> 17:53.180
For Al and Sil, that day was today.

17:54.030 --> 17:57.870
Roy! Why didn't you tell me
something so important sooner?

17:58.760 --> 18:00.520
I'm sorry, Yukito.

18:00.520 --> 18:03.390
Knowing how Al feels, 
I couldn't say anything.

18:10.070 --> 18:12.410
Hey, where are you going?

18:14.530 --> 18:15.400
Get on!

18:15.400 --> 18:17.240
If we rush, we might still make it.

18:17.510 --> 18:18.820
Thanks, Clen.

18:31.200 --> 18:34.000
Oneechan...

18:34.000 --> 18:35.600
We're short on time,

18:35.600 --> 18:37.470
finish that one with a sword.

18:39.510 --> 18:41.040
As a subject of this country,

18:41.040 --> 18:42.970
you should reverently accept your end.

18:46.620 --> 18:48.100
Go, Yukito!

18:58.200 --> 18:59.200
Yukito-san?!

18:59.820 --> 19:01.980
Who the hell are you?

19:01.980 --> 19:05.200
A friend of the deviants you loathe so much.

19:07.950 --> 19:11.120
Why the hell do they have to die?!

19:13.270 --> 19:16.000
Because they're deviants
who fear the end of life.

19:17.880 --> 19:20.300
And what is so deviant about fearing death?

19:20.300 --> 19:24.430
The phenomenon of one's life coming
to an end is nothing to fear.

19:24.710 --> 19:26.270
I knew those deviants from the
isolation camp were no good.

19:26.270 --> 19:27.470
Are they even citizens of the empire?

19:27.470 --> 19:29.490
End of life is obviously our duty.

19:29.490 --> 19:30.900
<i>I was wrong.</i>

19:30.900 --> 19:34.230
<i>These people's psychological
structure is exactly like...</i>

19:35.350 --> 19:38.650
The existence of the isolation camp
is a sign of our emperor's mercy.

19:44.870 --> 19:46.700
Yukito-san!

19:57.580 --> 19:58.840
Why?

20:02.040 --> 20:03.530
Why...?

20:04.960 --> 20:08.540
<i>Mitama-sama will surely save you.</i>

20:09.980 --> 20:14.000
<i>Neither I nor my shitty dad
deserve to be saved.</i>

20:14.480 --> 20:17.260
<i>It should be virtuous people, who've lead honest lives,</i>

20:17.260 --> 20:20.800
<i>and are kind to others—people like them.</i>

20:21.680 --> 20:23.860
<i>So, save them.</i>

20:23.860 --> 20:25.320
<i>Show me that you can save them.</i>

20:25.920 --> 20:28.620
Purify yourself, cleanse yourself,

20:29.850 --> 20:31.910
Believe only in our one God,

20:31.910 --> 20:35.030
then your wishes shall be granted...

20:35.810 --> 20:39.480
Be blessed by the supreme sacred treasure...

21:09.410 --> 21:11.080
Bertrand-sama, what on earth is this?!

21:11.080 --> 21:13.980
Yukito! You finally called on me!

21:13.980 --> 21:17.330
I guess you really can't
make it without me, huh?!

21:18.420 --> 21:21.500
Who did this to you while I wasn't here?

21:22.400 --> 21:24.950
That power you just used...

21:26.150 --> 21:27.340
Cleanse.

21:30.180 --> 21:32.560
<i>What is this? What is happening?</i>

21:32.560 --> 21:34.810
Plunge into terror darker than death!

21:39.850 --> 21:42.360
Yukito, I'll fix you right up.

21:42.360 --> 21:44.360
Eww, your insides are sticking out.

21:46.810 --> 21:48.690
What? I'm alive?

21:49.990 --> 21:51.920
Yukito-san?

21:49.990 --> 21:51.920
Yay, he's fixed.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.890
My cute Yukito!

21:54.580 --> 21:55.710
<b>My?</b>

21:55.710 --> 21:56.630
Huh? What?

21:56.630 --> 21:57.990
Who are you?

21:58.830 --> 22:00.330
How can you not know who I am?

22:00.330 --> 22:03.830
I was by your side more than
anybody else in the world!

22:04.920 --> 22:06.350
I'm Mitama.

22:06.350 --> 22:07.990
Your God!

23:40.020 --> 23:45.020
Episode 2:
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mikami

Beautiful is-

23:40.440 --> 23:45.020
{cut off, no script}
